":"2026-10-07-g2-p44","readingEdits":[],"uncertainties":[]},{"text":"先说一下假期比较重要的消息面啊，我只挑最重要的说哈。呢，你们如果看这些消息面的话，其实可以上东财啊，去看东财的要闻那一栏里边有很多哈，我就不挨个说了哈。","raw":"先说一下假期比较重要的消息面啊，我只挑最重要的说哈。呢，你们如果看这些消息面的话，其实可以上东财啊，去看东财的要闻那一栏里边有很多哈，我就不挨个说了哈。","sources":["be78af6fd1aa7a466b9b67c5e60861443187d873d24a7b2afa7318a202fe233b"],"attribution":"发言归属待核","confirmed":false,"kind":"speech","class":"","id":"2026-10-07-g2-p45","readingEdits":[],"uncertainties":[]},{"text":"我只挑重点的来说哈。","raw":"我只挑重点的来说哈。","sources":["be78af6fd1aa7a466b9b67c5e60861443187d873d24a7b2afa7318a202fe233b"],"attribution":"发言归属待核","confirmed":false,"kind":"speech","class":"","id":"2026-10-07-g2-p46","readingEdits":[],"uncertainties":[]},{"text":"首先是这个美国的非农数据大爆冷啊，然后非农数据公布之后，10月份不加，就美联储不加息的概率提高到了77.9%。","raw":"首先是这个美国的非农数据大爆冷啊，然后非农数据公布之后，10月份不加，就美联储不加息的概率提高到了77.9%。","sources":["be78af6fd1aa7a466b9b67c5e60861443187d873d24a7b2afa7318a202fe233b"],"attribution":"发言归属待核","confirmed":false,"kind":"speech","class":"","id":"2026-10-07-g2-p47","readingEdits":[],"uncertainties":[]}],"media":[{"id":"8cade574ef59a2fc32ea998276bae0aa5464f5f150f0400326e8f942521a7cc6","album":"10月7号vip群内容","type":"image","url":"media/8cade574ef59a2fc32ea998276bae0aa5464f5f150f0400326e8f942521a7cc6.webp","bytes":60214,"thumb":"thumbs/8cade574ef59a2fc32ea998276bae0aa5464f5f150f0400326e8f942521a7cc6.webp"},{"id":"800c30437619515fe7dd01a35ae3b50a2414786e1ccd385c00c4becdcc4a0bad","album":"10月7号vip群内容","type":"image","url":"media/800c30437619515fe7dd01a35ae3b50a2414786e1ccd385c00c4becdcc4a0bad.webp","bytes":76892,"thumb":"thumbs/800c30437619515fe7dd01a35ae3b50a2414786e1ccd385c00c4becdcc4a0bad.webp"},{"id":"554bb64d4d1489f841c185b7732dcba903edb3e796b927b538853f131b6c50b6","album":"10月7号vip群内容","type":"image","url":"media/554bb64d4d1489f841c185b7732dcba903edb3e796b927b538853f131b6c50b6.webp","bytes":84224,"thumb":"thumbs/554bb64d4d1489f841c185b7732dcba903edb3e796b927b538853f131b6c50b6.webp"},{"id":"cdcb48585490113733bea0a5d4e6a5880946e461742657cdd30baf98e9cf805